{"author":["Elastic"],"description":"检测Windowsdns.exe异常文件操作。对应需求：横向移动。官方：Unusual File Operation by dns.exe。","from":"now-9m","index":["winlogbeat-*","logs-endpoint.events.file-*","logs-windows.sysmon_operational-*","endgame-*"],"language":"kuery","license":"Elastic License v2","name":"【默认】Windowsdns.exe异常文件操作","note":"## 调查指引\n\n### 规则说明\nWindowsdns.exe异常文件操作\n\n### 为何重要\n向其他主机扩散\n\n### 调查步骤\n1. 核对告警实体、进程/网络字段与时间窗。\n2. 核对是否符合变更窗口与已知业务工具。\n3. 关联同主机或同账号前后同类告警。\n\n### 常见误报\n- 合法变更窗口内的运维、发布或安全扫描\n\n### 响应建议\n1. 确认是否授权与变更窗口。\n2. 无授权则隔离相关主机或账号并排查落地与外连。\n3. 按主机与用户关联前后同类告警。\n","setup":"## 设置说明\n\n1. 目标 Windows 主机安装 Elastic Agent，启用 **Elastic Defend**（按规则需要进程/网络/文件/注册表或安全日志）。\n2. 确认相关数据流有数据后再评估告警。\n","references":["https://research.checkpoint.com/2020/resolving-your-way-into-domain-admin-exploiting-a-17-year-old-bug-in-windows-dns-servers/","https://msrc-blog.microsoft.com/2020/07/14/july-2020-security-update-cve-2020-1350-vulnerability-in-windows-domain-name-system-dns-server/","https://www.elastic.co/security-labs/detection-rules-for-sigred-vulnerability"],"risk_score":47,"rule_id":"c7ce36c0-32ff-4f9a-bfc2-dcb242bf99f9","severity":"medium","tags":["操作系统: Windows","主题: 横向移动","来源: 默认","对应需求: 横向移动"],"timestamp_override":"event.ingested","type":"new_terms","query":"event.category : \"file\" and host.os.type : \"windows\" and\n  event.type : (\"creation\" or \"deletion\" or \"change\") and process.name : \"dns.exe\" and\n  not file.extension : (\"old\" or \"temp\" or \"bak\" or \"dns\" or \"arpa\" or \"log\")\n","threat":[{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1210","name":"Exploitation of Remote Services","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1210/"}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0008","name":"Lateral Movement","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0008/"}},{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1190","name":"Exploit Public-Facing Application","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1190/"}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0001","name":"Initial Acces